### Create a new event
POST http://localhost:8080/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Tech Conference 2026",
  "description": "Annual web development and API showcase",
  "date": "2026-11-15",
  "location": "Convention Center Room A"
}

### Update an existing event (Replace with a valid ID)
PUT http://localhost:8080/events/6aaba9cc3691eece10f6e033
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Tech Conference 2026",
  "description": "Updated description with new speakers",
  "date": "2026-11-16",
  "location": "Main Auditorium"
}

### Delete an event (Replace with a valid ID)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/events/6aaba9cc3691eece10f6e033